1
00:00:00,351 --> 00:00:03,891
(Amy:)Fine, it's true.
I deserve romance,

2
00:00:04,055 --> 00:00:06,555
(Amy:)and I didn't know how
else to make it happen.

3
00:00:07,391 --> 00:00:11,631
(Sheldon:)Well, if you want romance,
then let's have romance!

4
00:00:11,796 --> 00:00:14,206
Oh, look, there's wine. Mm!

5
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:17,983
(Sheldon:)Grape juice that burns.

6
00:00:18,135 --> 00:00:20,915
(Sheldon:)Now let's gaze
into each other's eyes.

7
00:00:21,072 --> 00:00:23,312
(Sheldon:)-You blinked. I win.
-Sheldon--

8
00:00:23,474 --> 00:00:25,924
(Sheldon:)Let's see. What's next?
Kissing's romantic.

9
00:00:44,262 --> 00:00:45,762
(Amy:)That was nice.

10
00:00:47,498 --> 00:00:49,038
(Sheldon:)Good.

11
00:00:51,035 --> 00:00:52,775
(Amy:)Um...

12
00:00:53,404 --> 00:00:56,854
(Sheldon:)The conductor said if I come
back to the engine room,

13
00:00:57,008 --> 00:01:02,018
(Sheldon:)he'd show me how to bring
the train through a crossing.

